            {"speaker": "Professora", "pt": "Exato. E que figura de linguagem marca a descrição do protagonista?", "en": "Exactly. And what figure of speech marks the description of the protagonist?", "ar": "تمامًا. وما المجاز الذي يميز وصف الشخصية الرئيسية؟"},
