                {"pt": "Os dados foram replicados; por conseguinte, a conclusão ganhou robustez.", "en": "The data were replicated; consequently, the conclusion gained robustness.", "ar": "أعيد إنتاج البيانات؛ وبالتالي اكتسب الاستنتاج قوة."},
                {"pt": "Ainda que o custo seja alto, o método demonstrou eficácia.", "en": "Even though the cost is high, the method proved effective.", "ar": "وإن كانت التكلفة مرتفعة، فقد أثبت المنهج فعاليته."},
